@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/topic_summary_settings/[project_uuid]
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "TopicSummarySettingsController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "统计管理平面的行\n+ 密码的账户数据" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n1 immutable task 在 event" as Outbox
participant "背景表演者\n统计管理平面" as Worker
Client -> API: PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/topic_summary_settings/{project_uuid}
API -> DB: 交易开始; 许可 + 变更
API -> DB: 在此文件中添加不可更改的内录 transactional outbox
DB --> API: 清理状态的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已固定的记录
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable delivery_snapshot_event\n(outbox_event_uuid, policy scope)
Worker -> DB: 应应用于计划/租的当前状态
note over Worker
没有公开事件行
没有控制器 WebSocket
主题任务保持独家性,从新帖子到旧帖子
end note
@enduml
